    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38178" body-key="m">
    
    
      alphabetical letter
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">م</span></b> 

[<i>The twenty-fourth letter of the alphabet;</i> called
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِيمٌ</span>. It is one of the letters termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَجْهُورَة</span>, or
vocal, and of those termed <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَفَهِيَّة</span> or labial: it is
a letter of augmentation. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  As a numeral, it
denotes <i>forty.</i>]

 </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
